  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "For aeons, our people had wandered aimlessly through the dark with only the crystals to guide them, clinging to each other to survive in the harsh landscape.",
    "value": "万古长夜中，吾族子民唯借水晶微光踽踽而行，于严酷天地间相濡以沫。"
