  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "The Lotus took pity on our struggling race, and, descending from a bright light in the sky, she touched the foreheads of two Eld'uu. One male, one female.",
    "value": "莲华之神垂怜挣扎吾族，自天光中降临，以辉芒轻触二古龙之额 - 一雄一雌。"
